      },
      {
        "text": "### Look for a date. \nAI information can be outdated.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/80fecd8228e305697202d6a056570cb6-Gemini_Generated_Image_8awb618awb618awb.png",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson7_level2_2026-b0772e02-addd-4741-9eab-dcf47fda2a50"
      },
      {
        "text": "###Ask for sources\nAsk AI to show you where it got its information.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/bcbd768afabe8f64a7b1bc78e0a232f8-Gemini_Generated_Image_kna4xdkna4xdkna4.png",
